    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d783">

                <pb facs="0738" n="640" sameAs="frus:frus1900/pg640"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hardy to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Athens</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1900-04-05"><hi rendition="#italic">April 5,
                        1900</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 33, Greek series.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to inclose herewith
                    further correspondence in the case of L. Economopoulos, all previous notes
                    between Mr. Romanos and myself having been forwarded in my No. 32 of March 22
                    last.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Arthur S. Hardy.</hi></signed></closer>



